Package: efcalc-pro
Version: 5.0.0~rc2
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6
Maintainer: Dr. Eric O. Flores <eoftoro@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/drericflores/efcalc
Description: Scientific and programmable calculator for Linux
 EfCalc Pro provides scientific calculations, variables, reusable formulas,
 conditionals, bounded loops, persistent history, and EFP program files in a
 native Qt6 graphical interface.
